config MPIPE_DISP
	bool "Display plugin support"
	select DISPLAY
	help
	  The sink element that puts frames on a screen, terminating a video
	  graph.

	  What it accepts comes from the panel rather than from the element: its
	  capabilities are enumerated from the display's own pixel formats and
	  resolution. A graph ending here therefore usually needs a converter in
	  front of it, unless the source already produces what the panel takes.
